  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We Effect 2023- Sep 2025 CSO-strategy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">We Effect 2023- sep 2025 CSO-strategin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det finns m&#xE5;l p&#xE5; flera niv&#xE5;er inom insatsen
F&#xF6;r partnerorganisationernas projekt, programmen och p&#xE5; den globala niv&#xE5;n. Insatsen best&#xE5;r av 10 landbaserade och regionala program. 
Varje program har ett eget m&#xE5;l. Inom ramen f&#xF6;r denna insats kommer We Effect rapportera per programm&#xE5;l samt p&#xE5; det &#xF6;vergripande programm&#xE5;let

Global niv&#xE5;

Effektm&#xE5;l: Structural and fundamental changes enabling physical and economic
access to adequate food, at all times, or means for its procurement, for every
man, woman and child, alone or in community with others.

&#xD6;vergripande programm&#xE5;l:
Strong, inclusive and democratic cooperatives and other member based civil society organisations that contribute to the right to food, resilience and sustainable livelihoods for their members and
communities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let f&#xF6;r insatsen &#xE4;r &quot;Starka, inkluderande och demokratiska kooperativ och andra medlemsbaserade civilsamh&#xE4;llesorganisationer som bidrar till r&#xE4;tten till mat, resiliens och h&#xE5;llbar f&#xF6;rs&#xF6;rjning och levnadsf&#xF6;rh&#xE5;llanden f&#xF6;r sina medlemmar och deras lokalsamh&#xE4;llen&quot;. Insatsen omfattar tio program i 19 l&#xE4;nder och genomf&#xF6;rs i samarbete med ca 160 partnerorganisationer. We Effects verksamhet genomsyras av de fem perspektiven och bidrar till f&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndring inom dem. Fattigdoms-, r&#xE4;ttighets- och j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhetsperspektiven pr&#xE4;glar verksamheten i h&#xF6;g grad. Dessa perspektiv &#xE4;r del av vision, m&#xE5;ls&#xE4;ttningar,  arbetss&#xE4;tt, strategier och metoder. N&#xE4;r det g&#xE4;ller milj&#xF6;- och klimatperspektivet visar organisationen p&#xE5; en h&#xF6;jd ambitionsniv&#xE5;. De flesta programmen inkluderar klimat och milj&#xF6; i sina m&#xE5;l och man har metoder och verktyg f&#xF6;r exempelvis milj&#xF6;bed&#xF6;mning. Flera av programmen arbetar med b&#xE5;de klimatanpassning och h&#xE5;llbara odlingsmetoder inom det sm&#xE5;skaliga jordbruket.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective for the contribution is &quot;Strong, inclusive and democratic cooperatives and other member-based civil society organisations that&#xA0;contribute to&#xA0;the right to food, resilience and sustainable livelihoods for their members and communities&quot;. The contribution includes ten programs in 19 countries and is implemented in cooperation with approximately 160 partnerorganisations. The five perspectives are integrated in We Effects operations and contribute to change within them. The poverty perspective, the rights based approach and the gender equality perspectives characterize the operations and programs to a great extent. These perspectives are part of the vision, objectives, working methods, strategies and methods. The organization shows a high level of ambition with regard to the environmental and climate perspective. A majority of the programs include climate and environment in the objectives and We Effect have methods and tools for eg environmental assessment. Several of the programs work with both climate adaptation and sustainable cultivation practices in small-scale agriculture.</narrative>
  </description>
